This page describes in detail how '''combat''' works in ''[[SkyrimVSE:Skyrim Very Special Edition|Skyrim Very Special Edition]]''. It includes information about skill progression, a list of all weapons, spells, and shouts in the game, and text used when attacking and killing enemies with them.

There are three skills: [[#Arms|Arms]], [[#Magic|Magic]], and [[#Shout|Shout]].
{{TOClimit|2}}

